usage: run_act_shadow.py [-h] --checkpoint CHECKPOINT [--stats STATS]
                         --capture-npz CAPTURE_NPZ --safety-summary
                         SAFETY_SUMMARY --output OUTPUT
                         [--device {auto,cpu,cuda}]
                         [--sample-stride SAMPLE_STRIDE]
                         [--task-coordinates-mm TASK_COORDINATES_MM TASK_COORDINATES_MM TASK_COORDINATES_MM TASK_COORDINATES_MM TASK_COORDINATES_MM TASK_COORDINATES_MM]

Infer from saved upright RGB/named feedback; no robot, camera or CAN
connection. python -m src.act.run_act_shadow --checkpoint ... --capture-npz
... --safety-summary ... --output ... [--device auto] This is a recorded-
observation audit, never a live control loop.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
  --stats STATS
  --capture-npz CAPTURE_NPZ
  --safety-summary SAFETY_SUMMARY
  --output OUTPUT
  --device {auto,cpu,cuda}
  --sample-stride SAMPLE_STRIDE
  --task-coordinates-mm TASK_COORDINATES_MM TASK_COORDINATES_MM TASK_COORDINATES_MM TASK_COORDINATES_MM TASK_COORDINATES_MM TASK_COORDINATES_MM
                        Measured base XYZ of source and destination cup
                        centres, for a 14-D model only
